xt", "text": "混合后体积不等于各体积之和（实际可能有收缩）"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "溶质总量计算错误"}]}]}]}, {"type": "highlightBlock", "attrs": {"backgroundColor": "#eff6ff", "borderColor": "#3b82f6", "icon": "📊"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "刷题建议：", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "混合溶液用十字交叉法最高效。记住浓度差的比 = 溶液量的反比。"}]}]}]}$$ AS jsonb), NULL, '数量关系-浓度问题-混合溶液的核心知识点和解题方法。', category_node.id, CAST('["数量关系", "浓度问题", "混合溶液"]' AS jsonb), FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, NOW(), 0, 0, CAST('{"content_type": "knowledge_point", "category_code": "kp_conc_mix", "source": "fba_content_engine"}' AS jsonb), 1, NOW()
